\itemize{
\item \strong{Marginal} uncertainty of each input property: the full SSURGO x SOLUS fused posterior
spread per pixel, propagated through Saxton-Rawls. Captured.
\item \strong{Dependence} (cross-property, cross-depth): the SSURGO tabular copula
